# PowerShell Admin Automation

This repository contains PowerShell scripts used to automate common IT administration tasks.

## Included Scripts
- Bulk Active Directory user creation
- Send Manager Notification Before Disabling inactive AD accounts 
- Installed software reporting
- System health reporting
- Microsoft 365 license reporting

## Technologies
- PowerShell
- Active Directory
- Windows Server
- Microsoft 365

## Disclaimer
Scripts are for learning and testing purposes. Always test in a non-production environment.

